{"id":"8e602c19b2984096","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-substitution.md","title":"Substitution","display":"df-substitution — Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-substitution","aliases":["93-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — Substitution","depends_on":["[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(T_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span> with constructor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span> is the recursively generated term set.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\)</span> is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> is a variable assignment to terms; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>延拓构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\\)</span>；唯一性由本文件的递归条件确定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\sigma:X\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists!h\\;\\Bigl[h:T_{\\tau}(X)\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(h(x)=\\sigma(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\sigma:X\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists!h\\;\\Bigl[h:T_{\\tau}(X)\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(h(x)=\\sigma(x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nh:T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\\to T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\n\\land h|_{\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}=\\sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\n\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\bigl(f,\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nh:T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\\to T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\n\\land h|_{\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}=\\sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\n\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\bigl(f,\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complete type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> indexes both substitution and its extension. The extension recovers its variable set as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\)</span> and its arities from the components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>, so it has no hidden <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,S,\\alpha\">\\(X,S,\\alpha\\)</span> parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{App}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\sigma:X\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists!h\\;\\Bigl[h:T_{\\tau}(X)\\to T_{\\tau}(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(h(x)=\\sigma(x))\\\\\n&\\hspace{5em}\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(X)^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\iota h\\;\\Bigl[{}&\nh:T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\\to T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)\n\\land h|_{\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}=\\sigma\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\n\\forall\\bar t\\in T_{\\tau}(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\;\\Bigl(\nh(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))=\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\bigl(f,\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\pi_2(\\tau)(f),\\bar t)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"X,S,\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":2326,"backlinks":[{"id":"5096907e2ea79ebf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq F$, $\\varphi\\in F$, and $\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ as in [[93-df-substitution]]."},{"id":"2a15e4e82341ff69","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c8026e52a7730811","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}$ and $\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}$ are the substitution predicate and its term extension from [[93-df-substitution]]."},{"id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ is the substitution predicate of [[93-df-substitution]]."},{"id":"d57b5a54109bb025","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"68b1723359ce7492","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}$ is the exact substitution predicate of [[93-df-substitution]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["a33dcee0f62c9026","ca7404158049be33","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","f10e7e3251fa7f7d"]}